{# ONE POSITION IN A DEPARTMENT'S CARD, and the control that files it elsewhere.

   THE ROW IS `.pitem`/`.pline`/`.pn`/`.held`/`.pacts` — the drawn card row from
   the positions design set's direction C, already in public/team.css.

   THE MOVE CONTROL IS THIS SCREEN'S ONE COMPOSITION. Nothing drawn moves a
   position between departments, because until this release nothing could: the
   matrix chooses a department when a position is CREATED and never again. So
   the control is built from the vocabulary the matrix's own create form uses —
   a `.sel` and a soft button in an `.assign` row — and it is the smallest
   honest thing that does the job. Needs a retroactive verdict.

   THE CURRENT DEPARTMENT IS THE SELECTED OPTION rather than being missing from
   the list, so the select reads as "where this is" and not as "where to send
   it". A move to where it already is costs a round trip and changes nothing,
   which is the right price for the control saying the truth about itself.

   NO JAVASCRIPT. The form posts; there is no auto-submit-on-change, because a
   select that wrote on change would move a position on a mis-click with no
   confirmation and no undo — and undo is precisely what this module does not
   have. #}
{%- set held = holders[position.uuidString]|default(0) -%}

<div class="pitem">
    <div class="pline">
        <span class="pn"><a href="{{ path('team_positions', {position: position.uuidString}) }}">{{ position.name }}</a></span>
        <span class="held">
            {%- if held %}{{ held }} holder{{ held == 1 ? '' : 's' }}
            {%- else %}<span class="pm-held0">nobody yet</span>{% endif %}
            &middot; {{ position.permissionValues|length }} permission{{ position.permissionValues|length == 1 ? '' : 's' }}
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="pacts">
        <form class="assign" method="post" action="{{ path('team_department_file', {uuid: position.uuidString}) }}">
            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
            <select name="department" class="sel" aria-label="File {{ position.name }} under">
                <option value=""{{ here is null ? ' selected' : '' }}>No department yet&hellip;</option>
                {% for department in departments %}
                    <option value="{{ department.uuidString }}"{{ here and here.id == department.id ? ' selected' : '' }}>{{ department.name }}</option>
                {% endfor %}
            </select>
            <button class="softbtn" type="submit">Move</button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>
